      "chunk_id": "slide_Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024_3_chunk_0_session_82ac0a16",
      "text": "Introduction to Aksha Aksha - Intelligent surveillance system is envisioned to automatically monitor the environment or premises with less or without human intervention. Such monitoring tasks include automatically detecting objects, unusual situations and performing further analysis and actions. Computer vision, Artificial Intelligence, and Gen AI play a very important role in developing such intelligent systems.",
