      "chunk_id": "slide_Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024_5_chunk_0_session_82ac0a16",
      "text": "Aksha Aksha, the smart surveillance system for the businesses that value employee safety. It is self learning system which detects object & anomalies using the power of Artificial Intelligence. It enables user to set customized alerts at fingertips. ‹#› Main features Live recording and processing of data Object detection Image analysis using Gen AI Objects: Person, supine person, no helmet, helmet, car, bicycle, truck, motorbike, backpack, handbag, gate open, gate closed, fork lift, crowd Insight report generation & analysis Using Gen AI Unsupervised learning based Anomaly detection Customized alert creation at fingertips",
