    {
      "chunk_id": "slide_Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024_14_chunk_0_session_82ac0a16",
      "text": "AlgoAnalytics and NDIL collaboration AlgoAnalytics customized “Aksha for workers safety” in collaboration with NDIL. This customized new Aksha version runs on “Edge + Cloud”. Three stages of Aksha customization with NDIL have been successfully finished by AlgoAnalytics; in Phase III, we added Gen AI to enhance Aksha features. Aksha POC on Raspberry Pi 4B & Interfaced two wireless cameras with it. Architectural changes to run Backend1 on Edge and UI on Azure Aksha Phase I FY23 Q4 Continuous support to NDIL team to run Aksha on Raspberry Pi 4B with both OS support Linux and SPECTRA. Aksha code optimization to achieve better FPS and Notification Aksha Phase II FY24 Q1 Enhanced Aksha features with Gen AI using Image prompt engineering. Improved Cloud architecture. Hardware mapping Aksha Phase III FY24 Q2 ‹#›",
