    {
      "chunk_id": "slide_Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024_16_chunk_0_session_82ac0a16",
      "text": "Current developments Aksha on multi edge: Mapping between edge devices and cameras The feed of all the cameras will be visible on the same GUI, whereas each camera will be running on a different hardware device, i.e. raspberry pi All the cameras run on the same network. Every camera communicates with the backend, which runs on the Azure app service. The feed is then sent to the front-end from the back-end Local Network RTSP RTSP Centralised GUI VPN ‹#›",
