    {
      "chunk_id": "slide_Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024_18_chunk_0_session_82ac0a16",
      "text": "Enhancing Aksha’s Scalability: Architecture and Advantages ‹#›   Effortless Scalability: Easily scale microservices with Kubernetes and manage high message volumes with Kafka. Decoupled Architecture: Allows independent service development and deployment, improving fault tolerance and maintainability. Real-time Data Processing: Facilitates real-time data streaming for timely insights and actions. High Availability: Maintains reliable performance through Kubernetes orchestration and Kafka’s distributed messaging.",
      "metadata": {
        "doc_id": "Aksha_Overview_Deck_Oct_2024",
